{"id":"542688360","kind":"article","title":"助记媒介的复习集使阅读过程产生了自然的中断","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4sXBJLQQrFYFUKPE9nrW5gDndYWCPP7Kic"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"助记媒介 & 思想工具","date":"2022-07-17","updated":"2022-07-17","votes":8,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":535,"keywords":["助记媒介","间隔重复","阅读理解","注意力"],"summary":"译文认为，阅读中穿插助记媒介复习集会自然打断连续长文，让读者在新学与复习间切换。卡片既能帮助确认自己理解了内容，也像路标一样帮助容易走神的读者回到原文。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/542688360","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"iEOJ4UCF\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zE1sr3TTDoEJut4hgai2w6qFUwBYHSkk7no\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">助记媒介卡片穿插在阅读的过程中</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>；在阅读时我注意到，复习集是喜闻乐见的，让人得以喘一口气。部分原因是我知道它们能让我确定自己在对文段进行理解（<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2TCHSDXHpLAH7137LZ5zZjcRVepwtrMVLpk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">材料中嵌入助记媒介卡片能带来安全感</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>），还有部分原因是它创造了另一种阅读体验。它打破了长文段，让我从「知新」切换到「温故」。</p><p data-pid=\"r736-86X\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4S7bk6dvuUUHrBUP58cn94r2zpUFfkBuUU7N\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gary Bernhardt</a>，Re: 回头见！ / 草稿：「将知识转化为间隔重复卡片」：</p><blockquote data-pid=\"io-GIhfX\">它们打破了连续的文本，我喜欢这种方式。我在阅读过程中会开小差（或者跳出文本？不确定），这也是我在长时间阅读时的常态。不过在这里，每个复习集就是一个标记点，保证我回到文本中。</blockquote><p data-pid=\"RKOCL2G2\">相关笔记：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"zcgo6MFC\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2HvBwx8Uqr7ErLp28oTuiKebTYy3RaRgv4B7\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">如何给助记媒介的复习集安排间隔？</a><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"fQBNK0eL\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zxRE7XavvhxgY3EkFduYB5B4fnMBknizq52u\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Eckhart Tolle 的停顿符号</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-1\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"cXFILz8p\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"463608296\" href=\"#/post/463608296\">助记媒介卡片穿插在阅读过程中</a></li><li data-pid=\"envYu_xq\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"478084993\" href=\"#/post/478084993\">助记媒介可能会促使读者更缓慢、更专心地阅读</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-2\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"a1kSLiu9\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"6TvUp4Ep\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4sXBJLQQrFYFUKPE9nrW5gDndYWCPP7Kic\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Mnemonic medium review sets create natural breaks in the reading experience (andymatuschak.org)</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 助记媒介卡片穿插在阅读过程中 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"463608296\" href=\"#/post/463608296\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 材料中嵌入助记媒介卡片能带来安全感 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"537188042\" href=\"#/post/537188042\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"541920687","title":"应用卡在多大程度上可以取代助记媒介中的回忆卡？","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":15,"minutes":3,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"543322217","title":"应用卡的答案不应该从记忆中得出","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":6,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"463608296","title":"助记媒介卡片穿插在阅读过程中","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":6,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"478084993","title":"助记媒介可能会促使读者更缓慢、更专心地阅读","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":10,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"537188042","title":"材料中嵌入助记媒介卡片能带来安全感","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":5,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[],"rec_answers":[]}